=2 Walkthrough
* While you are on Summoner as a main job, interact with the **House of the Hero** in {z:Windurst Walls} (Home Point #1) to speak to {p:Carbuncle}.
* Speak to {n:Juroro} in {z:Port Bastok} at (I-8) (Home Point #1). {n:Ildy-Goldy} will give you an {i:Earth Pendulum|Earth Pendulum|1169}.
