** If this is your first time visiting {z:Cloister of Tremors}, follow these directions:
*** Enter {z:Quicksand Caves} via {z:Eastern Altepa Desert} at (K-7).
*** Using the map below (click to enlarge), observe the red arrows. These are one-way drops.
*** Walk to (C-9) by dropping down twice the correct directions.

!Quicksand Caves-map1.jpg||Quicksand Caves map 1
* Trade the {i:Earth Pendulum|Earth Pendulum|1169} to the Protocrystal to enter the battle field.
** Inside you must defeat {m:Galgalim}, which is Level 56.
*** Trusts can be summoned.
*** Has Fire Spikes, Poison and a Paralyze.
* Speak to {n:Juroro} again.
* Speak to {p:Koru-Moru} in {z:Windurst Walls} at (E-7) to complete the quest and receive your reward.
